{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"1M75B2JFT3Z103D"},{"$ref":"1M75B2JFT3Z108E"},{"$ref":"1M75B2JFT3Z10C2"}],"opens":"Step one built on 2026-11-11: the code modules at the root, each store moved whole into the .glass of what it is about. In order from here, as the ninth session settled: second, glass's own format for one act, one commit, a line holding the act whole, its predecessor and which blocks are its own, two hashes, content and history, a holon kept in every store that holds it, landing blocks, then lines, then refs, old lines read as they are and the vectors made anew; third, the engine on attachments, with no store of its own, commits sent to the stores that hold what they change and refused where not writable or not admitted by a store's shape, the command line the engine's own, and canonical text and hashing moved to the engine once it stands on what it asks of any store rather than on glass's format; fourth, each store given its root, the stores cut where they hold two things, the engine's types and native functions out of the components' store and the author's words and sessions out of the main store into author, and the top of the field seen three ways; fifth, the site started from its store, with the browser's own store attached to be written; sixth, a buffer and then git as built-in integrations, each designed and attacked first, then how code mounts and runs. Carried after them: the lexicon a pure function over the field's strings, a Term a holon with a page of its own; rules that recurse; values in nested records as facts; the interface as the eighth session's inspection found it. Pinned: time and at, streams, programs beyond integrations. The next session begins at the second step, reading How the code is written before it writes code.","restsOn":[],"stands":"noted"},"id":"1M75B2JFT3Z11E3","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000007"],"name":"The plan from here","prev":null}
